      "message": "@Mikhail, Unrelated to the above discussion, the  EffectUtils::effectDescriptorToHal() does not populate apiVersion field of effect_descriptor_t. This field points to effect control interface version. \n\nTo address the above problem the library interface version of that effect is needed and this info is not available with af.",
